doc:Factsarticle_103 schema:abstract "This paper presents a fault diagnosis method for flyback switching power supply. The method integrates input current and output voltage information, constructs time-domain and wavelet-packet dispersion-entropy features, screens features with the MIV algorithm, and uses an NGO-SVM model for multiclass diagnosis."@en .
